            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu liste <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> gibi filmleri ve <code>1958</code> gibi vizyon tarihlerini içeriyor, ancak hangi tarihin hangi filme ait olduğu açık değil.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Vertigo\"</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu liste önce <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> ve <code>\"Parasite\"</code> filmlerini, ardından bunların vizyon tarihleri olan <code>1958</code> ve <code>2019</code> değerlerini içermeli.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"Vertigo\"</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
