          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 88424,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buradaki <code>movie_tuples</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi, ilişkili veri parçalarını bir <strong>demet</strong> ile gruplayabiliriz; bu demet film adlarını ve vizyon tarihlerini birlikte gruplar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"movie_tuples = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Demet, ilişkili verileri gruplar. İkinci filmdeki örneği izleyerek <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> ile <code>1958</code> değerlerini bir demette eşleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"movies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"movie_tuples = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Parasite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Vertigo&quot;, 1958]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
