          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 88353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Tuples</strong> help us group different pieces of data that belong together, like in the <code>vertigo_data</code> tuple here.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vertigo_data)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>vertigo_data</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <strong>demet</strong>, birbiriyle ilişkili verileri gruplar. Kodun <code>('Vertigo', 1958)</code> yazdırması için <code>\"Vertigo\"</code> ve <code>1958</code> değerlerini <code>vertigo_data</code> içinde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"vertigo_data\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Vertigo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1958\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"vertigo_data\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;Vertigo&quot;, 1958]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Vertigo', 1958)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>(\"Vertigo\", 1958)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
