            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Özel bir durum olarak, yalnızca bir değere sahip demetler zaten virgülle biter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17',)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"joe_17\"</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tek değerli bir demette de değerin ardından virgül bulunmalıdır. Kodun <code>('joe_17',)</code> yazdırması için <code>\"joe_17\"</code> değerini <code>user_data</code> içinde sakla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_data = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe_17&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"joe_17\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Joe Reed&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('joe_17',)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"joe_17\"</code>, ardından <code>,</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
