            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değerleri parantezlerle çevreleyerek bir demet oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"birthday = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mae&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;14.05&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(birthday)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Mae', '14.05')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>\"Mae\", \"14.05\"</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodun <code>('Mae', '14.05')</code> yazdırması için <code>\"Mae\"</code> adını ve <code>\"14.05\"</code> doğum tarihini bir demette grupla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"birthday = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mae&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;14.05&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(birthday)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('Mae', '14.05')\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(</code>, ardından <code>\"Mae\", \"14.05\"</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
